# Copy to .env to arm optional features. .env is gitignored; never commit real
# values. The build works with all of this unset — that is the default state.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- analytics
# Cookieless, no consent banner required. QUESTIONS.md Q13.
# Leave unset and no analytics script is emitted at all.
#
#   cloudflare  PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID = the beacon token from the Cloudflare
#               Web Analytics dashboard. Free.
#   plausible   PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID = the site domain, e.g. eivinasn.com.
#               PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_HOST only if self-hosting. Paid.
#   umami       PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID = website id.
#               PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_HOST is REQUIRED, e.g. https://analytics.example.com
#               Free if self-hosted.
#
# Arming this widens the CSP automatically — rerun `npm run build`.

# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=cloudflare
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_HOST=
